 "_doc": "The picks of the painted icons (out_painted/, anima_gen.py --style painted), as picks.json is for the flat ones: `variant` — the variant put into the game (absent — 1), `redo` — drawn badly in both, left as they are in the game, `overlay` — a mark drawn by code over the icon on install (overlays.py), `same` — an icon laid from another's picked variant, `drawn` — a whole icon drawn by code (overlays.ICONS), `from` — an icon taken from another folder of tools/anima, where FLUX drew it far better than Anima («Конец хода», «Мистический заряд»); `redraw` — the author's marks «перерисовать» of pick.py with what is wrong (pick.py --marked). Read by install.py --picks.",
